    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44468" root="&#xA;                        وجه&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            8
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ يَتَّجِهْ لِشَىْءٍ</span></b> 
                         (S, K, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بور</span>; and M, K,
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بلد</span>; &amp;c.) <i>He did not apply himself rightly
to anything; he knew not the right course to
pursue;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ يَهْتَدِ</span>. See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْمَقُ مَا يَتَوَجَّهُ</span>;
and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَائِرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمَّى</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّجَهَ لَهُ رَأْىٌ</span>
                        <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَحَ</span>.
(S, TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَحَ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّجَهَ إِلَى</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الصِحَّةِ</span>
                        <i>He became convalescent.</i>
